# Database (Prisma 7)

## Schema Location

- Schema: `packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma`
- Config: `packages/database/prisma.config.ts` (Prisma 7 style)
- Generated client: `packages/database/src/generated/prisma`

## Client Setup

Uses driver adapter (`@prisma/adapter-pg` + `pg` pool). Access via `getPrisma()` singleton in `packages/database/src/index.ts`.

## Migration Workflow

```bash
# 1. Edit schema.prisma
# 2. Create migration
pnpm db:migrate
# 3. Client regenerates automatically
```

Migration naming: `YYYYMMDDHHMMSS_description` (e.g. `20260608120000_add_transaction_notes`).

## Models

- `User` — Google OAuth, token storage
- `EmailSync` — on-demand Gmail sync jobs (`SyncStatus`)
- `GmailMessage` — ingested message metadata + body path
- `Transaction` — extracted or manual; soft delete via `isDeleted`
- `PresetFilter` — named dashboard filter presets per user; soft delete via `isDeleted`; `dateRange` is JSONB `{ startDate?, endDate? }` only

When dashboard filter facets change, update `PresetFilter` columns and migrate — see `.cursor/rules/preset-filters.mdc`.

## Enums

`SyncStatus` and `TransactionType` are defined here but also exported from `@repo/constant` for TypeScript apps. Do not duplicate enum values elsewhere.
